{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can install Svelte Query via "},{"type":"link","href":"https://npmjs.com","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NPM"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"npm","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NPM"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm i @tanstack/svelte-query","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/svelte-query","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"yarn add @tanstack/svelte-query","lang":"bash"},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Wanna give it a spin before you download? Try out the "},{"type":"link","href":"../examples/basic","children":[{"type":"text","value":"basic"}]},{"type":"text","value":" example!"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"npm","text":"NPM","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nYou can install Svelte Query via [NPM](https://npmjs.com).\n\n### NPM\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/svelte-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/svelte-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nyarn add @tanstack/svelte-query\n```\n\n> Wanna give it a spin before you download? Try out the [basic](../examples/basic) example!\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: installation\ntitle: Installation\n---\n\nYou can install Svelte Query via [NPM](https://npmjs.com).\n\n### NPM\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/svelte-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/svelte-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nyarn add @tanstack/svelte-query\n```\n\n> Wanna give it a spin before you download? Try out the [basic](../examples/basic) example!\n"}
